<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ford cut by Salomon on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ford cut by Salomon on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst John Kirnan downgraded Ford Motor Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- noted shares have risen 31 percent in year to date and 50 percent since Salomon recommended stock in February 1996.</p>
<p>-- said in a summary report Ford shares &quot;statistically are not expensive. However, automotive valuations are unlikely to materially change until (the company) can both improve its performance in a downturn and/or show a better balance of automotive earnings.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares were up 5/8 to 41-1/4.</p>
</text>
